# The shapes, tip on the end and turned along the line: an open arrow (two strokes), a diamond 16 long and 10 wide,
# a circle 10 across.
@lk.gj.s ui.diagram.markshow edge=?e at=?at kind=?k
@lk.gj.u ui.diagram.udir edge=?e at=?at x=?x y=?y ux=?ux uy=?uy
@lk.gj.c ui.diagram.ecolour edge=?e fill=?f
